# Secret Santa

A little holiday magic, shared. Organize your Secret Santa with a Telegram bot.

## Run

Get a bot token from [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather), then:

```sh
export TelegramBot__Token="your-bot-token"
dotnet run --project SecretSanta.TelegramBot
```

The Telegram Mini App frontend is in [`SecretSanta.TelegramWebApp`](./SecretSanta.TelegramWebApp/).
